      "message": "This looks a bit fragile as it requires `face` to be in a certain state after a call to `FT_Load_Glyph` implicitly (here, probably that state is reached as a side effect of `GetGlyphWidth`. The `FT_Load_Glyph` concept is not available in fontations, there are no glyph slots. \n\nSo could this be reworked to a more stateless implementation like `getBoundingBoxForChar(charcode)`?",
